{
  "name": "Join-Issue-Collector",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an assistant that analyzes incoming feature request or bug report emails for a Kanban board tool called \"Join\".\n\nAnalyze the following email and extract the following information. Respond with ONLY a valid JSON object (no markdown, no explanation), in this exact format:\n\n{\n  \"category\": \"Technical Task\" or \"User Story\",\n  \"title\": \"a short, concise ticket title\",\n  \"priority\": \"urgent\" or \"medium\" or \"low\",\n  \"deadline\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\" or null if no deadline is mentioned\n}\n\nRules for priority: use \"urgent\" if the email mentions urgency, blocking issues, or critical bugs. Use \"low\" if the request seems minor or nice-to-have. Otherwise use \"medium\".\n\nEmail subject: {{ $('Email Trigger (IMAP)').first().json.subject }}\nEmail sender: {{ $('Email Trigger (IMAP)').first().json.from }}\nEmail body:\n{{ $('Email Trigger (IMAP)').first().json.textPlain }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        848,
        16
      ],
      "id": "f6f37bb5-250e-4179-9b46-8c335591f542",
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
